  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/features/info.css" />
  <script src="/lib/MobileNavHandler.js" defer></script>
  <%- include('./partials/icons') %>
  <style>
    .info-container .intro {
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      padding: 0.9rem 0 0.4rem;
    }

    .info-container .intro p {
      margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
      max-width: 720px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .info-container .quick-links {
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .info-container section {
      padding: 20px 22px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .info-container section h2 {
      margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    }

    .info-container section p {
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .info-container section ul,
    .info-container section ol {
      margin: 0.7rem 0;
      padding-left: 1.1rem;
    }

    .info-container section ul li,
    .info-container section ol li {
      margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .info-container section ul li::before {
      left: -0.95rem;
      top: 0.34rem;
    }

    .flow-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .flow-card {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--blue3) 0%, rgba(47, 64, 84, 0.75) 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--blue);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
    }

    .flow-card h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .flow-card ol {
      margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
      padding-left: 1.4rem;
    }

    .flow-card ol li {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .benefit-visual {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--blue);
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    .benefit-visual--screenshot {
      max-height: 360px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .benefit-visual--character {
      display: block;
      width: min(100%, 250px);
      max-height: 250px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
      object-fit: contain;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .benefits-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 250px;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .benefits-media {
      justify-self: end;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .benefit-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .benefit-item {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue3) 0%, var(--blue4) 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--blue);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
    }

    .benefit-item strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      color: var(--orange2);
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .benefit-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .info-container section {
        padding: 16px 15px;
      }

      .benefit-visual--screenshot {
        max-height: 260px;
      }

      .benefit-visual--character {
        width: min(100%, 220px);
        max-height: 220px;
      }

      .benefits-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .benefits-media {
        justify-self: center;
        order: -1;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<%- include('./partials/google') %>

<body>
  <%- include('./partials/nav') %>
  <div class="container-fluid p-3 info-container">
    <div class="intro">
      <h1 class="text-center">Find and Join Online Dungeons and Dragons Games</h1>
      <p>
        Browse <strong>Public Wyrlds</strong> to find online D&amp;D campaigns, request to join, or list your own game as a host.
        Far Reach Co. combines a fast browser VTT, persistent campaign spaces, and shared table audio.
      </p>
      <small>
        <a href="/wyrlds/public">Browse Public Wyrlds</a>
        |
        <a href="/public-wyrlds-admin-guide">How to Host and Recruit Players</a>
        |
        <a href="/register">Create Free Account</a>
      </small>
      <hr>
    </div>

    <div class="quick-links" aria-label="Page sections">
      <a href="#start-flow">Start Flow</a>
      <a href="#find-join">Find + Join</a>
      <a href="#new-players">New Players</a>
      <a href="#become-dm">Become a DM/GM</a>
      <a href="#benefits">Why Far Reach Co.</a>
      <a href="#tools">Tools</a>
      <a href="#start-now">Start Now</a>
    </div>

    <section id="start-flow">
      <h2>How to Get Started in 5 Minutes</h2>
      <img
        class="benefit-visual benefit-visual--screenshot"
        src="/assets/landing/vtt_screenshot.png"
        alt="Far Reach Co virtual tabletop and campaign workspace preview"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div class="flow-grid">
        <article class="flow-card">
          <h3>Player Flow: Find and Join a Game</h3>
          <ol>
            <li>Open the <a href="/wyrlds/public">Public Wyrld Directory</a>.</li>
            <li>Read summary, join mode, and featured onboarding record.</li>
            <li>Create a free account and send a short join request.</li>
            <li>Join once approved.</li>
          </ol>
        </article>
        <article class="flow-card">
          <h3>Host Flow: Create a Listing and Recruit Players</h3>
          <ol>
            <li>Create your Wyrld and add a clear description.</li>
            <li>Enable public listing and choose Request to Join or Invite Only.</li>
            <li>Set a featured onboarding record.</li>
            <li>Review requests and approve best-fit players.</li>
          </ol>
          <p class="mb-0">
            Host setup walkthrough: <a href="/public-wyrlds-admin-guide">Public Wyrlds Admin Guide</a>.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="find-join">
      <h2>Find and Join DnD Campaigns Online</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Public Wyrlds</strong> are campaign listings hosts choose to publish for player discovery.
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li>Browse the <a href="/wyrlds/public">Public Wyrld Directory</a> and open matching listings.</li>
        <li>Check join mode and read the featured onboarding record.</li>
        <li>Create a free account and send a short intro request.</li>
        <li>Join once approved by the host.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        Need context first? Read the <a href="/public-wyrlds-guide">Public Wyrlds Guide</a>. Want host perspective?
        <a href="/public-wyrlds-admin-guide">Read the admin guide</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="new-players">
      <h2>New to Online Tabletop RPGs?</h2>
      <p>
        Start with campaigns that clearly explain cadence, table rules, and onboarding in the featured record.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Read campaign expectations before requesting to join.</li>
        <li>State your experience level and preferred play style.</li>
        <li>Start with one campaign and build consistency from there.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="become-dm">
      <h2>Want to Become a Game Master? Start Your Own Campaign</h2>
      <p>
        Create a Wyrld, list it publicly, and recruit players already searching for games.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Create a Wyrld and set campaign basics.</li>
        <li>Enable public listing and choose your join mode.</li>
        <li>Add an onboarding record.</li>
        <li>Review requests and build your party.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Setup help: <a href="/public-wyrlds-admin-guide">Public Wyrlds Admin Guide</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="benefits">
      <h2>Why Players and Hosts Use Far Reach Co.</h2>
      <div class="benefits-layout">
        <div class="benefits-content">
          <div class="benefit-grid">
            <div class="benefit-item">
              <strong>Campaign Persistence</strong>
              Keep maps, records, and linked sheets in one campaign space.
            </div>
            <div class="benefit-item">
              <strong>Recruitment Built In</strong>
              Public listings connect hosts and players faster.
            </div>
            <div class="benefit-item">
              <strong>Controlled Access</strong>
              Choose request mode, invite-only, and capacity limits.
            </div>
            <div class="benefit-item">
              <strong>Fast Session Setup</strong>
              Browser VTT plus shared audio gets sessions running quickly.
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 mb-0">
            Need a quick platform overview? Read <a href="/what-is-frc">What is Far Reach Co?</a> or
            <a href="/simple-virtual-tabletop-no-player-accounts">Simple Virtual Tabletop With No Player Accounts</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefits-media">
          <img
            class="benefit-visual benefit-visual--character"
            src="/assets/landing/character.png"
            alt="Far Reach Co character and campaign tools"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="tools">
      <h2>Tools for Running Online games Successfully</h2>
      <p>
        Run most tabletop systems with the same core workflow. Built-in support is deepest for <strong>D&amp;D 5E</strong>.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>VTT</strong> for maps, tokens, and shared play space.</li>
        <li><strong>Far Reach Radio</strong> for synced session audio.</li>
        <li><strong>Records and discussion</strong> for campaign coordination.</li>
        <li><strong>Linked character sheets</strong> with strong D&amp;D 5E support.</li>
        <li><strong>Public listing controls</strong> for visibility and intake.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Learn the platform: <a href="/what-is-frc">What is Far Reach Co?</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="start-now">
      <div class="seo-cta-block">
        <p>Ready to play or run your own game?</p>
        <a class="seo-cta-primary" href="/register">Create Free Account</a>
        <a class="seo-cta-secondary" href="/wyrlds/public">Find Campaigns to Join</a>
        <a class="seo-cta-secondary" href="/public-wyrlds-admin-guide">List Your Campaign and Find Players</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <%- include('./partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>
